description:
Solid K Gold Bracelet, 7 &quot;
Made in Italy
Crafted in K White Gold

100% real leather. Genuine leather accessories have been used for many years. Keep them away from water and high humidity and you won't miss them;
DIMENSIONS: 5.75 x 4 x 0.35 inches. Designed for a standard passport;
Royal Arms embossing. We use a special embossing technique to make it clear and attractive;
100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: if you are not satisfied with your purchase, you can return it without any problem. However, if you have problems with our product, please contact us first and we will resolve the problem as soon as possible;
The Leather Passport Cover is packed in a black FABRIC POUCH .The Cover is inside the pouch. It is a bonus for extra protection of the cover.
